<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1625) <span class="when">Oct 15, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Pulls and develops through DaVinci Resolve work again when Asobi has to start Resolve.</b> A project made while Resolve is still starting can&#8217;t take any media, so every such pull failed with &#8220;DaVinci Resolve couldn&#8217;t import&#8221;. Asobi now makes the project again until it can. This matters for Canon RAW plates, and for RED and Blackmagic RAW on a Mac without their decoders.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1476) <span class="when">Oct 12, 2026</span></h3>
